span('U',3,'reviewed_composite_primary_statements_audited',['FixedNormalCompositeConvergence','FixedNormalCompositeLocal','FixedNormalCompositeEndToEnd'],'Strong convexity of the full coupled F only for U.1.1; tangential-only alternative verified separately. Uniform local basin chooses epsilon before arbitrary actual run.')
